@startuml
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database Database
participant NodeMCU
participant "Biometric Module" as Biometric

== Login Process ==
User -> Frontend: Open Login Page
Frontend -> Backend: POST /login (credentials)
Backend -> Database: Validate Credentials
Database --> Backend: Credentials Valid
Backend -> Frontend: Login Success
Frontend -> Biometric: Prompt for Biometric Verification
Biometric --> Frontend: Biometric Verified

== Attendance Marking ==
User -> NodeMCU: Scan Device MAC
NodeMCU -> Backend: Send MAC Address
Backend -> Database: Check MAC Validity
Database --> Backend: Valid MAC Found
Backend -> Database: Record Attendance
Backend -> Frontend: Attendance Marked Successfully

== Scanned Network Sync ==
NodeMCU -> Backend: Send Scanned Networks (SSID & MAC)
Backend -> Database: Save or Update Network Info
Backend --> NodeMCU: Network Data Synced

== View Attendance ==
User -> Frontend: Request Attendance Records
Frontend -> Backend: GET /attendance
Backend -> Database: Fetch Attendance Records
Database --> Backend: Attendance Data
Backend --> Frontend: Send Attendance Data
Frontend -> User: Display Attendance

@enduml
